       LOCKED LIBRARY - only the DB owner may merge (.github/CODEOWNERS)

       identity.staff has FAN-IN = 14, measured from the real schema. Seven of
       nine services import this library, so one PR changing a column type here
       can break all seven at once.

       In exchange it CHANGES VERY SLOWLY. That is exactly why the federated
       entity approach works: high fan-in libraries change slowly, fast-changing
       libraries have low fan-in.
       ============================================================ -->
